 talent-card px-[16px] \"><div class=\"talent-card__content\"><div class=\"talent-card__header c--4 text-center\"><h3 class=\"name title title--h3 c--4\"><span class=\"firstname\">Nirina</span><span class=\"lastname\">Rakotomalala</span></h3><div><span>QA Engineer</span></div></div><div class=\"talent-card__body\"><div class=\"img-container\"><img src=\"http://escouade.loc/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/talent-profile-2.png\" alt=\"\"/><img src=\"http://escouade.loc/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/talent-profile-2.png\" alt=\"\"/></div></div><div class=\"talent-card__footer\"><blockquote><i class=\"es-icon-quotes\"></i><div class=\"c--3\"><span>Comprendre les enjeux métiers est essentiel pour proposer les bonnes solutions</span></div></blockquote></div></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:create-block/talent-card -->\n\n<!-- wp:create-block/talent-card {\"firstname\":\"Thomas\",\"lastname\":\"Leroy\",\"role\":\"Développeur full stack\",\"quote\":\"La confiance est un levier clé dans la réussite des projets.\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"http://escouade.loc/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/talent-profile-3.png\",\"alt\":\"\",\"id\":150}} -->\n<div class=\"card talent-card px-[16px] \"><div class=\"talent-card__content\"><div class=\"talent-card__header c--4 text-center\"><h3 class=\"name title title--h3 c--4\"><span class=\"firstname\">Thomas</span><span class=\"lastname\">Leroy</span></h3><div><span>Développeur full stack</span></div></div><div class=\"talent-card__body\"><div class=\"img-container\"><img src=\"http://escouade.loc/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/talent-profile-3.png\" alt=\"\"/><img src=\"http://escouade.loc/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/talent-profile-3.png\" alt=\"\"/></div></div><div class=\"talent-card__footer\"><blockquote><i class=\"es-icon-quotes\"></i><div class=\"c--3\"><span>La confiance est un levier clé dans la réussite des projets.</span></div></blockquote></div></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:create-block/talent-card --></div></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:create-block/talents-block -->\n\n<!-- wp:create-block/cta-image-block {\"image\":{\"url\":\"http://escouade.loc/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/intro-img-1.png\",\"alt\":\"\",\"id\":158}} -->\n<div class=\"block cta-image-block bgc bgc--3a \"><div class=\"cta-image-block__content uk-container\"><div class=\"cta-image-block__body\"><div class=\"card cta-card\"><div class=\"cta-card__background scale-x-[-1]\"><img src=\"http://escouade.loc/wp-content/themes/aura/public/build/assets/bg-6-CPDKQyS0.png\" alt=\"\"/></div><div class=\"cta-card__content flex flex-col-reverse md:flex-row-reverse\"><div class=\"cta-card__header\"><figure class=\"img-container\"><img src=\"http://escouade.loc/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/intro-img-1.png\" alt=\"\"/><img src=\"http://escouade.loc/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/intro-img-1.png\" alt=\"\"/></figure></div><div class=\"cta-card__body\"><div class=\"content\"><h2 class=\"title title--h1 c--4\"><span>Osez faire le premier pas</span></h2><div class=\"text\"><p>Vous avez du potentiel, même sans offre publiée. Présentez votre profil et créez votre opportunité.</p></div><div class=\"actions flex flex-col sm:flex-row md:flex-wrap items-stretch gap-[20px]\"><a class=\"btn btn--lg c--4 bgc--5 btn-shadow-sm\" href=\"#\" title=\"Candidature spontanée\"><span>Candidature spontanée</span><i class=\"es-icon-chevron-right\"></i></a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:create-block/cta-image-block -->','Carrière','','inherit','closed','closed','','121-revision-v1','','','2026-04-01 11:03:03','2026-04-01 11:03:03','',121,'http://escouade.loc/?p=177',0,'revision','',0),(178,2,'2026-04-01 11:32:00','2026-04-01 11:32:00','','logo angular','','inherit','open','closed','','logo-angular','','','2026-04-20 10:15:18','2026-04-20 10:15:18','',13,'http://escouade.loc/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/logo-angular.png',0,'attachment','image/png',0),(179,2,'2026-04-01 11:32:35','2026-04-01 11:32:35','<!-- wp:create-block/hero-block {\"button\":{\"text\":\"Rejoindre l’aventure\",\"url\":\"\",\"openInNewTab\":false}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-create-block-hero-block\"><div class=\"block hero-text-block\"><div class=\"hero-text-block__content min-h-[60vh] gap-[70px] uk-container\" uk-scrollspy=\"cls:uk-animation-fade\" data-uk-parallax=\"y: 50vh; opacity: 1, 0;  start: 0; end: 10vh; blur: 0, 0, 20px; scale: 1, 0.5;\"><div class=\"hero-text-block__body\"><h1 class=\"title title--h1 rte rte--em-c-5\"><small class=\"block\"><span>Une <strong>Escouade</strong>, c\'est <em>plus qu\'une équipe</em> :</span></small><span>c\'est une aventure humaine</span></h1></div><div class=\"hero-text-block__footer flex justify-center\"><a class=\"btn c--4 bgc--5-2 btn--lg btn-shadow-lg\" href=\"\" title=\"Rejoindre l’aventure\"><span>Rejoindre l’aventure</span><i class=\"es-icon-chevron-right\"></i></a></div></div></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:create-block/hero-block -->\n\n<!-- wp:create-block/content-block {\"background\":\"\",\"headingText\":\"\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-create-block-content-block\"><div class=\"block bgi  edito-block\"><div class=\"edito-block__content uk-container flex flex-col gap-[64px]\"><div class=\"edito-block__header hidden\"></div><div class=\"edito-block__body flex flex-col gap-[64px] sm:gap-[76px] md:gap-[88px] lg:gap-[100px]\"><!-- wp:create-block/content-card {\"bodyText\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eChez Escouade, nous croyons que la réussite d\'un projet repose avant tout sur les personnes.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eBasée à Madagascar, notre société réunit des développeurs passionnés et les connecte à des projets stimulants portés par nos partenaires en Europe.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003ePlus qu’un simple recrutement, nous créons de véritables escouades : des équipes soudées, humaines et performantes.\\u003c/p\\u003e\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"http://escouade.loc/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/edito-img-1.png\",\"alt\":\"\",\"id\":30}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-create-block-content-card\"><div class=\"block edito-card \"><div class=\"edito-card__content flex flex-col md:flex-row\"><div class=\"edito-card__header\"><figure class=\"img-container\"><img src=\"http://escouade.loc/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/edito-img-1.png\" alt=\"\"/></figure></div><div class=\"edito-card__body\"><div class=\"content\"><h2 class=\"title title--h3 c--1a\"><span>Qui sommes-nous</span></h2><div class=\"text\"><div><p>Chez Escouade, nous croyons que la réussite d\'un projet repose avant tout sur les personnes.</p><p>Basée à Madagascar, notre société réunit des développeurs passionnés et les connecte à des projets stimulants portés par nos partenaires en Europe.</p><p>Plus qu’un simple recrutement, nous créons de véritables escouades : des équipes soudées, humaines et performantes.</p></div></div><div class=\"actions\"><a class=\"btn c--4 bgc--5 btn-shadow-sm\" href=\"#\" title=\"Découvrir l\'Escouade\"><span>Découvrir l\'Escouade</span><i class=\"es-icon-chevron-right\"></i></a></div></div></div></div></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:create-block/content-card --></div></div></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:create-block/content-block -->\n\n<!-- wp:create-block/tech-block -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-create-block-tech-block\"><div class=\"block bgi bgi--4 tech-slider-block\"><div class=\"tech-slider-block__content uk-container\" data-uk-slider=\"autoplay:true; pause-on-hover:true; autoplay-interval:5000; velocity:0\"><div class=\"tech-slider-block__body overflow-x-hidden\"><div class=\"card tech-slider-card uk-slider-items uk-child-width-1-1\" data-uk-scrollspy=\"cls:uk-animation-scale-up; target: .tech-item,h2 em; delay: 35; repeat: true\"><!-- wp:create-block/tech-card -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-create-block-tech-card\"><div class=\"tech-slider-card__content\"><div class=\"tech-slider-card__header flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between px-[40px] md:items-center\"><h2 class=\"title title--h2 rte rte--em-c-5 c--2\"><span>Les technologies <em>Frontend</em><small>au coeur de nos réalisations</small></span></h2><ul class=\"nav flex gap-[10px] m-0 justify-start\"><