\",\"id\":30}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-create-block-content-card\"><div class=\"block edito-card \"><div class=\"edito-card__content flex flex-col md:flex-row\"><div class=\"edito-card__header\"><figure class=\"img-container\"><img src=\"http://escouade.loc/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/edito-img-1.png\" alt=\"\"/></figure></div><div class=\"edito-card__body\"><div class=\"content\"><h2 class=\"title title--h3 c--1a\"><span>Qui sommes-nous</span></h2><div class=\"text\"><div><p>Chez Escouade, nous croyons que la réussite d\'un projet repose avant tout sur les personnes.</p><p>Basée à Madagascar, notre société réunit des développeurs passionnés et les connecte à des projets stimulants portés par nos partenaires en Europe.</p><p>Plus qu’un simple recrutement, nous créons de véritables escouades : des équipes soudées, humaines et performantes.</p></div></div><div class=\"actions\"><a class=\"btn c--4 bgc--5 btn-shadow-sm\" href=\"#\" title=\"Découvrir l\'Escouade\"><span>Découvrir l\'Escouade</span><i class=\"es-icon-chevron-right\"></i></a></div></div></div></div></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:create-block/content-card --></div></div></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:create-block/content-block -->\n\n<!-- wp:create-block/tech-block -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-create-block-tech-block\"><div class=\"block bgi bgi--4 tech-slider-block\"><div class=\"tech-slider-block__content uk-container\" data-uk-slider=\"autoplay:true; pause-on-hover:true; autoplay-interval:5000; velocity:0\"><div class=\"tech-slider-block__body overflow-x-hidden\"><div class=\"card tech-slider-card uk-slider-items uk-child-width-1-1\" data-uk-scrollspy=\"cls:uk-animation-scale-up; target: .tech-item,h2 em; delay: 35; repeat: true\"><!-- wp:create-block/tech-card -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-create-block-tech-card\"><div class=\"tech-slider-card__content\"><div class=\"tech-slider-card__header flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between px-[40px] md:items-center\"><h2 class=\"title title--h2 rte rte--em-c-5 c--2\"><span>Les technologies <em>Frontend</em><small>au coeur de nos réalisations</small></span></h2><ul class=\"nav flex gap-[10px] m-0 justify-start\"><li><button class=\"btn c--4 bgc--1-2 btn-shadow-sm px-0 size-[48px] flex items-center justify-center\" data-uk-slider-item=\"previous\"><i class=\"es-icon-chevron-left\"></i></button></li><li><button class=\"btn c--4 bgc--1-2 btn-shadow-sm px-0 size-[48px] flex items-center justify-center\" data-uk-slider-item=\"next\"><i class=\"es-icon-chevron-right\"></i></button></li></ul></div><div class=\"tech-slider-card__body md:px-[10px] uk-child-width-1-1\"><ul class=\"tech-list gap-[10px] gap-y-[20px] md:gap-y-[40px] lg:gap-y-[50px]\"><!-- wp:create-block/tech-item {\"logo\":{\"url\":\"http://escouade.loc/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/tech-logo-react-icon.png\",\"alt\":\"\",\"id\":71},\"name\":\"React\"} -->\n<li class=\"wp-block-create-block-tech-item tech-item\"><figure><div class=\"img-container\"><img src=\"http://escouade.loc/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/tech-logo-react-icon.png\" alt=\"React\"/></div><figcaption><span>React</span></figcaption></figure></li>\n<!-- /wp:create-block/tech-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:create-block/tech-item {\"logo\":{\"url\":\"http://escouade.loc/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/tech-logo-vue.js.png\",\"alt\":\"\",\"id\":80},\"name\":\"Vue.js\"} -->\n<li class=\"wp-block-create-block-tech-item tech-item\"><figure><div class=\"img-container\"><img src=\"http://escouade.loc/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/tech-logo-vue.js.png\" alt=\"Vue.js\"/></div><figcaption><span>Vue.js</span></figcaption></figure></li>\n<!-- /wp:create-block/tech-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:create-block/tech-item {\"logo\":{\"url\":\"http://escouade.loc/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/tech-logo-nodejs.png\",\"alt\":\"\",\"id\":66},\"name\":\"jQuery\"} -->\n<li class=\"wp-block-create-block-tech-item tech-item\"><figure><div class=\"img-container\"><img src=\"http://escouade.loc/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/tech-logo-nodejs.png\" alt=\"jQuery\"/></div><figcaption><span>jQ