entiel, même sans offre publiée. Présentez votre profil et créez votre opportunité.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Envoyez votre CV sur  <a href=\"mailto:recrutement@escouade.mg\"><mark style=\"background-color:#f473d0\" class=\"has-inline-color has-white-color\">&nbsp;recrutement@escouade.mg&nbsp;</mark></a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:create-block/cta-image-block -->','Carrière','','inherit','closed','closed','','121-revision-v1','','','2026-04-10 05:09:26','2026-04-10 05:09:26','',121,'http://escouade.loc/?p=341',0,'revision','',0),(342,2,'2026-04-10 06:18:29','2026-04-10 06:18:29','','QA auto Selenium','','inherit','open','closed','','qa-auto-selenium','','','2026-04-10 06:18:45','2026-04-10 06:18:45','',305,'http://escouade.loc/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/QA-auto-Selenium.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(344,2,'2026-04-10 06:20:15','2026-04-10 06:20:15','','PO confirmé','','inherit','open','closed','','po-confirme','','','2026-04-10 06:20:27','2026-04-10 06:20:27','',302,'http://escouade.loc/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/PO-confirme.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(345,2,'2026-04-10 06:20:57','2026-04-10 06:20:57','','Dev talend','','inherit','open','closed','','dev-talend','','','2026-04-10 06:21:13','2026-04-10 06:21:13','',164,'http://escouade.loc/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Dev-talend.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(348,2,'2026-04-10 07:44:47','2026-04-10 07:44:47','<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Éditeur du site</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Le site <a href=\"http://escouade.loc/\" data-type=\"page\" data-id=\"13\">escouade.mg</a> est édité par la société ESCOUADE</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>ESCOUADE<br>Société à responsabilité limitée unipersonnelle (SARLU) au capital de 1 000 000 Ar<br>RCS : 2025 B 00844<br>NIF : 4019312831<br>STAT : 62011 11 2025 0 10857<br>Siège social : Lot II M 92 Antsa